  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT making an appropriation to the \"Frank K. Skartados Living Trust\", on\nbehalf of the late Frank K. Skartados, member of the Assembly from the 104th\nassembly district, the balance due of his unpaid annual compensation for the\nportion of the year 2018",
    "basePrintNo": "S8862",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8862-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Appropriations",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8862\n\nSPONSOR: LARKIN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act making an appropriation to the \"Frank K. Skartados Living Trust\",\non behalf of the late Frank K. Skartados, member of the Assembly from\nthe 104th assembly district, the balance due of his unpaid annual\ncompensation for the portion of the year 2018\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo authorize payment of unpaid annual compensation to the \"Frank K.\nSkartados Living Trust\", on behalf of the late Frank K. Skartados,\nmember of the Assembly from the 104th assembly district.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 authorizes the sum of sixty-three thousand six hundred and\nninety-two dollars and thirty two cents ($63,692.32) to be appropriated\nout of the general fund for payment into the \"Frank K.  Skartados Living\nTrust\", on behalf of the late Frank K. Skartados, member of the Assem-\nbly, who died on the fifteenth day of April, 2018 for the balance due of\nthe unpaid annual compensation which would have been earned by him had\nhe continued to live and serve as such member until the end of the year\n2018.\n\nSection 2 provides that this act shall take effect immediately\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nIt has been the tradition of the Legislature to pay widows or widowers\nthe unpaid salaries of the Spouses who die while they are members of the\nLegislature.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\n$63,692.32\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
